msgstr "未獲得授權。裝置仍保持掛載。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/cli.sh:1468
msgid "Its filesystems were unmounted, but the drive is still in use, so it was not powered off. Do not disconnect it yet."
msgstr "其檔案系統已卸載，但磁碟機仍在使用中，因此未關閉電源。請先不要拔除。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/cli.sh:1473
msgid "Device disconnected"
msgstr "裝置已拔除"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/cli.sh:1474
