msgstr "修訂版："

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:49
msgid "source:"
msgstr "原始碼："

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:125
msgid "%s is the legacy script (2025 or earlier): it cuts NVMe and SD card names (nvme0n1p1 becomes nvme)"
msgstr "%s 是舊版指令稿（2025 年或更早）：它會截斷 NVMe 和 SD 卡的名稱（nvme0n1p1 會變成 nvme）"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:127
msgid "Symptoms: 'cat: /sys/block/nvme/removable' and 'Error looking up object for device /dev/nvme'. Update the big-mount package."
msgstr "症狀：「cat: /sys/block/nvme/removable」和「Error looking up object for device /dev/nvme」。請更新 big-mount 套件。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:130
msgid "%s reads /var/lib/sddm/state.conf without checking it may: 'Permission denied' when a user runs it"
msgstr "%s 未先檢查權限就讀取 /var/lib/sddm/state.conf：使用者執行時會出現「Permission denied」"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:132
msgid "Update the big-mount package. Never change the permissions of the files of SDDM to work around it."
msgstr "請更新 big-mount 套件。切勿為了繞過此問題而變更 SDDM 檔案的權限。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:135
msgid "%s has no diagnosis or safe removal: every option is ignored and it tries to mount the internal partitions instead"
msgstr "%s 沒有診斷或安全移除功能：所有選項都會被忽略，它會改為嘗試掛載內部分割區"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:137
msgid "Commands such as 'bigmount --diagnose' do not diagnose anything and may print permission errors. Update the big-mount package."
msgstr "「bigmount --diagnose」等指令不會進行任何診斷，還可能顯示權限錯誤。請更新 big-mount 套件。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/doctor.sh:145
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/drive.sh:692
msgid "Big-Mount"
