msgstr "依類型列出儲存區中現有的檔案，由您選擇要複製的項目。已刪除的檔案不在此清單上。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:31
msgid "Copy files directly"
msgstr "直接複製檔案"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:32
msgid "Copies everything, or the folders you choose, with their names. It does not filter by type, and it does not go through what you leave out."
msgstr "連同名稱複製全部內容或您選擇的資料夾。不會依類型篩選，也不會走訪您排除的項目。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:34
msgid "Deep analysis"
msgstr "深度分析"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:35
msgid "Searches every sector for files by their content. It can find what no longer appears, but names and folders are lost, some files come out incomplete and nothing is guaranteed."
msgstr "依內容在每個磁區中搜尋檔案。它能找到已不再顯示的檔案，但名稱和資料夾會遺失，部分檔案會不完整，且不保證任何結果。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:37
msgid "Make a disk image only"
msgstr "僅製作磁碟映像檔"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:38
msgid "Copies the whole device to a file on another disk with GNU ddrescue, keeping a map so it can resume and never reads a good area twice."
msgstr "使用 GNU ddrescue 將整個裝置複製到另一個磁碟上的檔案，並保留對照表，以便繼續執行，且絕不重複讀取良好的區域。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:40
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1076
msgid "Look for lost partitions"
msgstr "尋找遺失的分割區"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:41
#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:1083
msgid "TestDisk reads the partition table and analyzes the disk. It only shows what it finds: nothing is written."
msgstr "TestDisk 會讀取分割表並分析磁碟。它只會顯示找到的內容：不會寫入任何資料。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:47
msgid "Recovered"
msgstr "已復原"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:123
msgid "Recovered files"
msgstr "已復原的檔案"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:131
msgid "Files found"
msgstr "找到的檔案"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:268
#, python-format
