msgstr "用於映像檔或深度搜尋：每個磁區，不論儲存區為何。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:479
msgid "Only for a disk image, a deep search or lost partitions. To copy files, choose a volume above."
msgstr "僅用於磁碟映像檔、深度搜尋或遺失的分割區。若要複製檔案，請選擇上方的儲存區。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:480
msgid "The whole drive"
msgstr "整個磁碟機"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:507
msgid "Image file"
msgstr "映像檔"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:526
