msgstr "此儲存區的所有檔案。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:637
msgid "Only what you mark. Recommended on a drive with problems: the most important first."
msgstr "只複製您標記的項目。建議在有問題的磁碟機上使用：先複製最重要的。"

#: big-mount/usr/lib/big-mount/gui/pages/rescue.py:702
